        "text": "According to National Cable & Telecommunications Association (Petitioner), according to National Cable & Telecommunications Association (Petitioner), the case concerns the interpretation of the Pole Attachments Act, which requires the FCC to regulate pole attachments to ensure rates, terms, and conditions are just and reasonable."
      },
      {
