            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 40,
              "start": 40
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The statute defines \u201cutility\u201d as a person who owns poles, ducts, conduits, and rights\u2011of\u2011way used, in whole or in part, for wire communications."
