            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 45,
              "start": 45
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Incumbent local exchange carriers are excluded from the definition of \u201ctelecommunications carrier\u201d under the Act."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Steindler",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "107abe67cf54b0c5d5fa4e08efbf7103e6288b596bebb036dec1abba918487cc",
